        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Wind-fire Charge"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(divine)\n\nRequirements: Jin-Hae is wielding her wind and fire wheels\n\nJin-Hae blasts off on her wind and fire wheels, leaving an elemental trail in her wake. She Strides up to twice her Speed and makes a wind and fire wheel Strike at any point during her movement. The path left by her movement is filled with her choice of an 8th-level wall of wind or wall of fire spell. Jin-Hae is unaffected by any walls she creates with this ability. She cannot use Wind-Fire Charge again for 1d4 rounds. If she uses Wind-Fire Charge again, the wall created by her previous Wind-Fire Charge disappears as soon as her action is completed."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
